{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "d61cf6ee390b4eed856978ee5b40fac1",
    "m_Title": "Custom Particle Data",
    "m_Content": "This shader graph is set up to support Mesh Particle GPU Instancing with a Custom Particle Data Struct Layout.\r\n\r\nUsing any of the Particle Data nodes (Transforms, Color, TexCoords, AnimFrame) will result in including ParticleInstancing.hlsl and so requires adding the following pragma to the Preprocessor Directives in the Graph Settings.\r\ninstancing_options procedural:ParticleInstancingSetup\r\n\nBy including a custom Shader Include we can define the ParticleData struct layout:\n\nstruct CustomParticleInstanceData\r\n{\r\n    float3x4 transform;\r\n    uint color;\r\n    float agePercent;\r\n};\n\nAs well as a reflected function node to fetch the particle attribute when instancing is enabled.\n\nvoid GetParticleAge(inout half age)",
    "m_TextSize": 1,
    "m_Theme": 0,
    "m_Position": {
        "serializedVersion": "2",
        "x": -2067.0,
        "y": -294.0,
        "width": 1091.0,
        "height": 662.0
    },
    "m_Group": {
        "m_Id": ""
    }
}

